# DDR 2ndMIX (System 573, analog I/O board): first power-on. The 573 BIOS boots
# the CD, and the game asks "DO YOU WANT TO INITIALIZE FLASH-ROM?" (by frame 360):
# Test answers yes. Then it goes on towards attract mode with CD audio. Hashes the
# main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare HIRAKU's 573 core
# with MAME. The flash install is done by frame ~9600 ("FLASH-ROM INITIALIZE
# COMPLETE"); a second Test press starts the game: warning, title, How To Play,
# a demo song, the intro video.
game ddr2m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 600 press "Service Mode" 8
at 10200 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 24000 quit
